Next week, we'll have our annual joint meeting of IEEE-ISTO PWG and the
Linux Foundation Open Printing Summit hosted by Apple in Sunnyvale, CA.

  http://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/april_2015_sunnyvale.html

The following week, we'll resume our regular monthly OP teleconferences
with NEW NUMBERS as we are switching over to Free Conference Call
(freeconferencecall.com):

May 2015 - US/Europe/Brazil - OP Monthly Meeting

    - Note - skip week after joint PWG/OP Summit for travel

    - Tuesday 12 May 2015, Daytime
      - US
        10am in San Francisco - US PDT (Pacific Daylight Time)
        11am in Colorado - US MDT (Mountain Daylight Time)
        12pm in Chicago - US CDT (Central Daylight Time)
        1pm in New York - US EDT (Eastern Daylight Time)
      - Europe
        7pm in Berlin - CEST (Central Europe Summer Time)
      - Brazil
        2pm in Belo Horizonte - BRT (Brasilia Time)

US: +1 559-546-1301
